msgid "Market split problem {#market-split-problem}"
msgstr "Problema Market Split {#market-split-problem}"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Table 1 shows specific performance metrics for the Parity Twine Optimizer applied to various instances of the market split (MS) problem.\n"
"These were obtained from the [QOBLIB - Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB) and correspond to\n"
"[submissions](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/01-marketsplit/submissions/20260728_Parity_Twine_Optimizer) made to the\n"
"library using the Parity Twine Optimizer.\n"
msgstr ""
"La Tabella 1 mostra metriche di prestazione specifiche per il Parity Twine Optimizer applicato a varie istanze del problema Market Split (MS).\n"
"Sono state ottenute dalla [QOBLIB - Quantum Optimization Benchmarking Library](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB) e corrispondono alle\n"
"[submission](https://github.com/ZIB-AOPT/QOBLIB/tree/main/01-marketsplit/submissions/20260728_Parity_Twine_Optimizer) effettuate alla\n"
"libreria utilizzando il Parity Twine Optimizer.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-09-26 · verified 2026-09-29
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"MS violation is an accuracy metric that measures how far the solution is from satisfying all constraints, defined as $\\sum_i ((Ax - b)_i)^2$. Lower values of this metric indicate more accurate solutions.\n"
"Table 1 reports averaged values for five runs of each instance using the Parity Twine Optimizer with the `ibm_boston` device as a backend and 100,000 shots.\n"
"The minimum MS violation obtained from the runs of each instance is reported.\n"
msgstr ""
"La violazione MS è una metrica di accuratezza che misura quanto la soluzione sia distante dal soddisfare tutti i vincoli, definita come $\\sum_i ((Ax - b)_i)^2$. Valori più bassi di questa metrica indicano soluzioni più accurate.\n"
"La Tabella 1 riporta i valori medi di cinque esecuzioni per ciascuna istanza utilizzando il Parity Twine Optimizer con il dispositivo `ibm_boston` come backend e 100.000 shot.\n"
"Viene riportata la violazione MS minima ottenuta dalle esecuzioni di ciascuna istanza.\n"

